[2]: https://crates.io/crates/txtar
[3]: https://img.shields.io/badge/docs-latest-blue.svg?style=flat-square
[4]: https://docs.rs/txtar
[5]: https://img.shields.io/crates/l/txtar.svg?style=flat-square
